# Build context filter for deploy/Dockerfile (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore).
# Only what the image needs; never local data, secrets, or build output.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE
!NOTICE
!src/domus/
!src/frontend/
!examples/
src/domus/static/
src/frontend/node_modules/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.env
